| `crates/tools/src/classify.rs` | change | `Args.selfplay_side`, `Args.selfplay_dir`; enum `SelfplaySide`; fns `plays_selfplay`, `finish_selfplay`, `selfplay_file`, `play_side`; `selfplay_games` reads files only; `check` gains `selfplay_dir`; `run` wiring; module doc; 3 tests |
| `crates/tools/README.md` | change | the `classify` row (line 23): usage cell and one sentence |

Do not touch: `.github/` (a person's part, below), `spec/`, `scripts/`, every other crate, `crates/tools/src/selfplay.rs`, `arena.rs`, `golden.rs`, `luau.rs`.

Governing rules: R1365000 (stage 2's AI check: `SELFPLAY_GAMES` (8) self-play games on both builds, identical seed/log/hash/result means no AI change) and R1370000 (CI's `rust (classify)`). The same games are compared as before, so neither ruling's text changes and no new ruling is needed.

